{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/issues/16232","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/issues/16232/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/issues/16232/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/issues/16232/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/issues/16232","id":6024777731,"node_id":"I_kwDOCxQENc8AAAABZxrQAw","number":16232,"title":"Persistent queue starts empty after metadata read error","user":{"login":"Narayan201120","id":159036898,"node_id":"U_kgDOCXq14g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159036898?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120","html_url":"https://github.com/Narayan201120","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Narayan201120/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-25T13:08:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T13:08:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Component(s)\nexporter/exporterhelper\n\n### What happened?\nI traced `Start()` through `initClient()` to confirm. If storage returns an error while reading `qmv0`, the queue treats it like unusable metadata, resets to an empty state, and `Start()` still returns nil. If a new request is offered before storage recovers, the fresh write index can overwrite an existing queue entry.\n\n**Steps to reproduce**\n1. Persist a request in a queue.\n2. Restart with a storage client that returns an error for `Get(\"qmv0\")`.\n3. Observe that `Start()` succeeds and the queue appears empty.\n4. Offer a new request; it can overwrite the stored request at index 0.\n\n**What did you expect to see?**\nThe startup error is returned, the client is closed, and the stored request remains available after storage recovers.\n\n**What did you see instead?**\nThe queue starts with empty metadata after a storage read error and may overwrite persisted data on a later offer.\n\n### Collector version\nmain at 821485556\n\n### Environment information\nOS: Windows, amd64\nCompiler: Go 1.27.1\n\n### Additional context\nTracking PR: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/pull/16230. The PR adds a regression test for this startup failure.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/issues/16232/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/issues/16232/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://